      "text": "#CalmSunday #TrafficUpdate #Lekki #IkoroduRoad #LagosAbeokutaExpress \n\nTraffic is fluid within the metropolis; driving in and out of Lagos is a breeze as well. \n\n- Agege Motor Road to Lagos, Abeokuta, all the way to Abule Egba is good. \nCharity intersection, Social Club, Olaniyi is all good.\n\n- Lekki Epe Expressway, Freedom Way in and out is good as well. Ajah, Abraham Adesanya, Sangotedo, Abijo, is all good.\n\n- Ikorodu Road is good as well; Fadeyi to Anthony, Ojota, Ketu, and Mile 12 is good.\n\nOur men are strategically located to ensure traffic on our roads is smooth.\n\n@jidesanwoolu @drobafemihamzat @seunosiyemi_ \n@lagosMOT1  @Sola_Giwa @walemusa @Mr_JAGs @lagostraffic961",
